# SPA

- Add screens to the code-based route tree in `templates/spa/src/app/router.tsx`. Lazy-load the page component. Guard authenticated routes in `beforeLoad` by reading `useAuthStore.getState().session` synchronously.
- Put a feature in `templates/spa/src/features/<name>/` with `schema.ts`, `api.ts`, `keys.ts`, and `hooks.ts`. Keep the page component beside them.
- API functions call `api.request` from `templates/spa/src/lib/api.ts`, pass the query `signal`, and set `retry: false` on mutations.
- Query keys live in a factory such as `taskKeys`. Mutations cancel in-flight queries, apply an optimistic cache update when the UI needs it, roll back on error, and invalidate on settle.
- TanStack Query owns server state. Zustand is for theme and the `sessionStorage` session snapshot.
- Add shadcn components with the aliases in `templates/spa/components.json`. Compose classes with `cn` from `@/lib/utils`.
- MSW handlers live in `templates/spa/src/mocks`. Browser and node setups share those handlers.
